      "content": "i get what you're saying but i've been reading some stuff online where people say that teaching kids about this stuff too early is actually harmful or that it's better to stick to biological facts so they aren't confused later on. since you're the expert, how do you respond to that? is there any merit to the idea that we should wait until they're older, or is that just an outdated view?",
